新しい関係を試みる少年たち。未来への選択と、人間とモノとの関係の答えを求められる——。進化しすぎた機械と、人間世界を繋ぐのは何か？便利になりすぎた時代で何が大事で何が必要なのか、アラトは人間よりはるかに優れたアンドロイド・レイシアと出会ったことで未来への選択と、人間とモノとの関係の答えを求められる——。","tagline":"それは、人間と人智を越えた存在との決別と共存の物語"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/utyPwLrlaxz6sWQzz6y9acGyEkv.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/utyPwLrlaxz6sWQzz6y9acGyEkv.png","language":"xx","width":782,"height":81}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2PtN9nZJYEXiklRe1T5DxwIKED9.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2PtN9nZJYEXiklRe1T5DxwIKED9.jpg","language":"ja","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d8Rs0pznQndb4yXqvPJfeHTn68S.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/d8Rs0pznQndb4yXqvPJfeHTn68S.jpg","language":"ja","width":800,"height":1090},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gzDAMiJDgDXl3xRqfXKrE0lLSea.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gzDAMiJDgDXl3xRqfXKrE0lLSea.jpg","language":"ja","width":1000,"height":1426},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tVJDgThHXxza4rDmVwrt3bsXmtc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tVJDgThHXxza4rDmVwrt3bsXmtc.jpg","language":"ja","width":680,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zD5jXFy4UGv7kSkPLbpFq9V7X66.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zD5jXFy4UGv7kSkPLbpFq9V7X66.jpg","language":"ja","width":680,"height":1000}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/juCG27Tfj0RUvMguqw2MGtQ4S3r.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/juCG27Tfj0RUvMguqw2MGtQ4S3r.jpg","language":"en","width":1920,"height":1080},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f3eKz8QvUB9i4KDkb65TPyb1bcG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f3eKz8QvUB9i4KDkb65TPyb1bcG.jpg","language":"en","width":1920,"height":1080},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image